  sentences:
  - You wish to marry me? Unfortunately I cannot grant love related wishes.
  - He's rejecting the dragon? Maybe I have my chances then...
  - Hush!
  - It's alright my Princess, love shall come on the way. I only ask that you grant
    me the honor of being in your presence, oh mighty Princess.
  - Hmmm... I see. I shall grant this wish, dragon. What of your two other wishes?
  - I have no other wish to see fulfilled my Princess. I'm already a great mighty
    dragon who can have any riches, except for the greatest one of them all, your
    love. I will earn it fair and square!
  - '*Squeals* I ship it!'
  - ... Daughter mine, sometimes I'm concerned about you.
  - I will win this tournament to show you proof of my resolve, and then I will woo
    you. I can't wait!
